{
  "rule": "https://packslip.dev/release/v1/#resources",
  "description": "Which resource entries apply once an artifact is selected. For each thing the entries describe, a consumer keeps those that fit the artifact and, of them, the most specific; entries for different things never hide one another. `expect` lists the surviving entries by their zero-based position in `predicate.resources`, in document order. Entries that survive together are alternatives, tried in the source order the Resources section gives; these vectors cover which entries survive, not which source is tried first.",
